*~

# The "copy-circlepack-jar-to-project-root" step in pom.xml drops a copy of
# the built main jar here after every local `mvn package`/`mvn verify` --
# harmless for local convenience, but it shouldn't get committed: the jar
# is now published automatically as a GitHub Release asset by CI on each
# version tag (see .github/workflows/build.yml), so a copy checked into
# the repo would just be dead weight that goes stale immediately.
/CirclePack-v*.jar
